g\\\n  \\ against the narrow one) is what breaks:\\nverified directly \\u2014 `pytest tests/runtime/test_plan26_topology.py::\\n\\\n  test_an_unwired_undeclared_node_fails_the_build_by_stable_id` fails with\\n\\\"DID\\\n  \\ NOT RAISE\\\" against the current repository state.\\n\\nFix: make the repro call\\\n  \\ consistent with how the victim was selected \\u2014 use\\n`G.full_binding_inventory()`\\\n  \\ for the `register_skeleton` call too (since\\n`candidates` is computed against\\\n  \\ what that same wide set actually wires).\\nDo not change how `candidates` is selected\\\n  \\ (that logic is already correct);\\nonly the call on the line that currently reads\\\n  \\ `G.register_skeleton(fresh_\\nbuilder(), G.binding_inventory())` needs `G.binding_inventory()`\\\n  \\ replaced\\nwith `G.full_binding_inventory()`.\\n\\nThis is the only change needed.\\\n  \\ Do not touch anything else in this file, and\\ndo not touch `graph.py`, `routing.py`,\\\n  \\ or any other file. Re-run this node's\\nfull required verification command\\n(`{python}\\\n  \\ -m pytest -q tests/runtime/test_plan26_topology.py\\ntests/runtime/test_plan26_state_reducers.py\\n\\\n  tests/runtime/test_plan26_deterministic_nodes.py\\ntests/runtime/test_plan26_model_nodes.py`)\\\n  \\ and confirm it is fully green\\nbefore reporting `status: PASSED` as a bare line.\\n\"\ncontext: {}\ncreated_at: '2026-08-13T00:01:04.955693+00:00'\n(eval):1: == not found","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PSbq9eN5HQ6ejiyKZJok7T"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a940455c-9d17-4ecf-b4d2-495f467d9f1a","uuid":"34522d2d-e7a7-4545-91e3-2f2ef4869758","timestamp":"2026-08-13T00:13:31.752Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 1\nschema_version: 1\npatch_id: P-N20-002\naction: overlay\ngraph_id: plan26_langgraph_curriculum_factory_implementation\nbase_graph_digest: 18d619bb4eb509d1c6c590699ce2072660f36781c33cbc18a4ad1f9f8501cac7\ntarget_node: N20_GRAPH_COMPILER\nscope: node_only\nreason: 'P-N20-001''s own fix to